{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Tower Lab</strong>, a physics-driven tower defense roguelike where towers interact and every projectile obeys real physics. Build elaborate contraptions that push, pull, and launch enemies off floating levels through creative experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/ea2f4f81a57644e0a354c97019acbcaf.avif?t=1763527259\" width=616 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/5b77f46f8cb9f042463f9a554d30b9cc.poster.avif?t=1763527259\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/5b77f46f8cb9f042463f9a554d30b9cc.webm?t=1763527259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/5b77f46f8cb9f042463f9a554d30b9cc.mp4?t=1763527259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the laws of physics to your advantage!</strong> Every projectile and enemy is physics-driven, allowing for dynamic interactions and unexpected outcomes. Enemies don't have health - they must\u00a0be physically knocked off the map to be defeated. Exploit the environment to maximize your defensive strategies, using obstacles and physics objects to your benefit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/fffb0428f6bbf7a0e49dffee73897220.avif?t=1763527259\" width=616 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/12cc515c43a15f657d0f468b2a9a2758.poster.avif?t=1763527259\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/12cc515c43a15f657d0f468b2a9a2758.webm?t=1763527259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/12cc515c43a15f657d0f468b2a9a2758.mp4?t=1763527259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creativity is key.</strong> Experiment with physics-driven towers to craft powerful contraptions. Suspend, redirect, amplify, and combine forces in unexpected ways to create devastating chain reactions. No single tower is the solution - true mastery comes from discovering unique synergies that transform simple mechanics into game-breaking strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/3dd04b9ad43ea32e399dccd8008e2a1f.avif?t=1763527259\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/9541e748a4ad0f0329ef212f05ec472c.poster.avif?t=1763527259\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/9541e748a4ad0f0329ef212f05ec472c.webm?t=1763527259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/9541e748a4ad0f0329ef212f05ec472c.mp4?t=1763527259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your perfect physics engine!</strong> Every tower and trap you add to your deck shapes how you manipulate the battlefield. Earn Matter to unlock new towers, upgrade with powerful Modules, or refine your deck by removing towers that no longer fit your strategy. Every run is a fresh puzzle of physics-based mayhem!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3084810?t=1763527259","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/daf7e2910bd90123b65f490a5463540efa2f0782/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763527259","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/b9d3747b98431c98b85833ff68d29f4f87d3380e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763527259","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/b9d3747b98431c98b85833ff68d29f4f87d3380e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763527259","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Tower Lab</strong>, a physics-driven tower defense roguelike where towers interact and every projectile obeys real physics. Build elaborate contraptions that push, pull, and launch enemies off floating levels through creative experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/ea2f4f81a57644e0a354c97019acbcaf.avif?t=1763527259\" width=616 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/5b77f46f8cb9f042463f9a554d30b9cc.poster.avif?t=1763527259\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/5b77f46f8cb9f042463f9a554d30b9cc.webm?t=1763527259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/5b77f46f8cb9f042463f9a554d30b9cc.mp4?t=1763527259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the laws of physics to your advantage!</strong> Every projectile and enemy is physics-driven, allowing for dynamic interactions and unexpected outcomes. Enemies don't have health - they must\u00a0be physically knocked off the map to be defeated. Exploit the environment to maximize your defensive strategies, using obstacles and physics objects to your benefit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/fffb0428f6bbf7a0e49dffee73897220.avif?t=1763527259\" width=616 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/12cc515c43a15f657d0f468b2a9a2758.poster.avif?t=1763527259\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/12cc515c43a15f657d0f468b2a9a2758.webm?t=1763527259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/12cc515c43a15f657d0f468b2a9a2758.mp4?t=1763527259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creativity is key.</strong> Experiment with physics-driven towers to craft powerful contraptions. Suspend, redirect, amplify, and combine forces in unexpected ways to create devastating chain reactions. No single tower is the solution - true mastery comes from discovering unique synergies that transform simple mechanics into game-breaking strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/3dd04b9ad43ea32e399dccd8008e2a1f.avif?t=1763527259\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/9541e748a4ad0f0329ef212f05ec472c.poster.avif?t=1763527259\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/9541e748a4ad0f0329ef212f05ec472c.webm?t=1763527259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/9541e748a4ad0f0329ef212f05ec472c.mp4?t=1763527259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your perfect physics engine!</strong> Every tower and trap you add to your deck shapes how you manipulate the battlefield. Earn Matter to unlock new towers, upgrade with powerful Modules, or refine your deck by removing towers that no longer fit your strategy. Every run is a fresh puzzle of physics-based mayhem!</p>","developers":["Play Tug Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/3447fce3a440e985d8e286a5bcc244ee395d9902/header.jpg?t=1763527259","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 with SSE2 s